1
00:00:00,773 --> 00:00:02,473
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:03,196 --> 00:00:05,126
Well, there was this girl.

3
00:00:05,498 --> 00:00:07,428
What did you do?

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,430
Nothing.

5
00:00:08,501 --> 00:00:11,401
Really, it was just kissing.

6
00:00:12,939 --> 00:00:14,569
(sighs)

7
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,240
(Leonard:)All right.

8
00:00:16,308 --> 00:00:18,548
So, we're still
getting married?

9
00:00:20,412 --> 00:00:21,582
(Sheldon:)Yes.

10
00:00:22,881 --> 00:00:24,851
Because we love each other.

11
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:26,516
(Sheldon:)Yes.

12
00:00:26,585 --> 00:00:29,955
And it's the happiest day
of our life.

13
00:00:30,022 --> 00:00:31,322
(chuckles)
Don't push it.

14
00:00:34,059 --> 00:00:36,229
I need some time
to take a step back

15
00:00:36,295 --> 00:00:39,465
and reevaluate our situation.

16
00:00:40,499 --> 00:00:42,099
(Leonard:)Oh.

17
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:44,207
Bye, Sheldon.

18
00:00:46,638 --> 00:00:48,638
Well, Gollum...

19
00:00:50,775 --> 00:00:53,975
...you're an expert on rings.

20
00:00:54,045 --> 00:00:56,345
What do I do with this one?

21
00:00:59,484 --> 00:01:01,554
(Penny:)So, what package
are you thinking?

